  "content": "<h1>🛠️ 利用 Create 的强大功能制作 Chipped 方块！</h1>\n<p>想用 <strong>Chipped</strong> 方块为你的建筑增添趣味，但又热爱使用 <strong>Create</strong> 进行自动化合成？这个模组将两者的优点完美结合！<br><strong>现在你可以使用 Create 模组的机械与机制来制作 Chipped 方块了。</strong>是时候自动化你的美学创作了！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🔧 需求</h2>\n<p>要使用此模组，你需要同时安装 <strong>Create</strong> 和 <strong>Chipped</strong> 模组。请在下方选择你的版本：</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/static/images/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + Forge (1.20.1 和 1.19.2)</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BrayDog2010/devins-badges/ab6c523498e18dcf2d63411e7522aa3a27d0a84c/assets/cozy/requires/chipped_forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Chipped Forge\"></a></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://fabricmc.net/assets/favicon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + Fabric (1.20.1 和 1.19.2)</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create-fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create Fabric\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BrayDog2010/devins-badges/ab6c523498e18dcf2d63411e7522aa3a27d0a84c/assets/cozy/requires/chipped_fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Chipped Fabric\"></a></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://neoforged.net/img/authors/neoforged.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + NeoForge (1.21.1 和 1.20.1) 仍需要 Chipped 但暂无图标</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create NeoForge\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📦 其他下载渠道</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafting-recipes-for-create\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Curseforge\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📦 源代码与问题反馈</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/BrayDog2010/Crafting-Recipes-For-Create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"Github\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>将 Chipped 方块无缝集成到 Create 模组的合成系统中</li>\n<li>兼容 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge 加载器</li>\n<li>支持 Minecraft 版本 <strong>1.20.1</strong>、<strong>1.19.2 和 1.21.1 (仅限 NeoForge)</strong></li>\n<li>非常适合建筑爱好者和自动化爱好者</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬 \"既然能用工程学创造方块，何必手动制作呢？\"</p>",
